                                <rect key="frame" x="18" y="627.66666666666663" width="378" height="57.333333333333371"/>
                                <string key="text">Recurring billing. Cancel anytime. With Squeal Unlimited, you get unlimited access to hundreds of original chat stories in the Squeal library. The subscription will automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can go to your iTunes Account settings to manage your subscription and turn off auto-renew. Your iTunes Account will be charged when the purchase is confirmed. If you subscribe before your trial ends, the rest of your free trial will be forfeited as soon as your purchase is confirmed. By using Squeal, you agree to our Terms of Use and Community Guidelines.</string>
                                <fontDescription key="fontDescription" name="SFProDisplay-Regular" family="SF Pro Display" pointSize="8"/>
